{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When he wakes up, he finds himself in an escape pod. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">He has no memory, doesn't know where he is, and can't even remember his own name.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533360/extras/store_P_seak1.gif?t=1741712537\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">He arrives at a shopping street but there is no one there. Only a robot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533360/extras/robots.gif?t=1741712537\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The robot speaks to him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;You have temporarily lost your memory. If you want to regain your memory quickly, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">you should go to the museum and look around at various things.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> With nowhere to go, he decides to head to the museum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf Obtain a secretary hidden somewhere and learn and strengthen command skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0 It can also be learned at a dojo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533360/extras/airslash.gif?t=1741712537\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533360/extras/flying_disc.gif?t=1741712537\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533360/extras/jump_upper_cut.gif?t=1741712537\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533360/extras/strike.gif?t=1741712537\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533360/extras/helm_smash.gif?t=1741712537\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533360/extras/biggest_wave.gif?t=1741712537\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf Enemies have attributes, and each has their own resistances and weaknesses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Weapons and command skills also have attributes, so you can change weapons depending on the enemy or use command skills to exploit their weak points when fighting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf Filiy Friends are somewhere, so find them and make them your allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Filiy Friends' abilities will expand the places you can explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533360/extras/FF_3.gif?t=1741712537\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cfExplore this star and find out why everyone has disappeared.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3533360?t=1741712537","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533360/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741712537","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533360/fa2d33bf9f80083b02df02b4ab652291f69f7b06/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741712537","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533360/fa2d33bf9f80083b02df02b4ab652291f69f7b06/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741712537","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"descrip